// T29 (RFC §7.5): an unlawful act with an unbounded `Int` parameter and no `explore-domain`
// menu must return INCONCLUSIVE (exit 3) under `--mode adversarial`, never green pass.
Fact actor_t Identified by Eve.
Fact drained Identified by int.

// No `Holds when` (always unlawful), parameterized by `int` with no menu:
Act unauthorized-drain Actor actor_t Related to int
  Creates drained(int).

Invariant vault-intact
  When !(Exists drained: drained.int > 9999).
